Yet ATG shorted Bitcoin ETFs dollar for dollar beside its stake;
a short can gain when prices fall, offsetting losses Bitcoin makes.
The coin-price risk was canceled, but its Empery votes remained;
it still stood to gain if the stock’s discount waned.

